      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHAMA (2) has been in sparkling form, last time showing brilliant early pace and proving too slick around Cannington over 601m in 34.59, making it five wins on end. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Flying at the moment and expecting another big run. SNAPPY SNACKER (5) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when second (38.01) at this track. Solid record here winning five races. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in this for a long way. CAPALLA (4) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (42.45) last time in a Grade 4/5 at Cannington. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Should play a prominent role. SMELL LIKE ROSE (1) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
